<item>
            <title>[JGVT-4441] Balance Interface: Combine all Preparations from Subtables</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-4441</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;As a user,&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;I want&lt;/b&gt; to be able to filter preparations across all Preparation Subtables, from just one overview in &quot;GxP Preparation Balance&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;So that&lt;/b&gt; .&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;my work becomes much more efficient.&#160;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Important&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;
to better discriminate between preparations, add: &quot;description&quot; column&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Design notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;columns added marked in orange for design purposes, omit design formatting.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;enable async loading of Preparation Subtables so page loading doesn&apos;t take too long.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Demo/Screen Shots:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Add a button (Balance Icon, orange marking is for dev purposes only) on the &quot;Preparations Master&quot; table to open a form, similar to the existing &quot;GxP Preparation Balance&quot; external action, however where all preparations from all subtables are listed (and sortable, searchable).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/7150112/7150112_image-2026-08-11-14-09-56-312.png&quot; height=&quot;191&quot; width=&quot;511&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Default view&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/7149877/7149877_image-2026-08-11-13-58-23-606.png&quot; height=&quot;332&quot; width=&quot;376&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Filter with search&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/7149872/7149872_image-2026-08-11-13-51-11-686.png&quot; height=&quot;192&quot; width=&quot;375&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
